        "id": 1962375
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-19T16:44:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah I\u0027m bit unsure if this change is needed either -- e.g. there already are [modules](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/apps/Nfc/Android.bp;drc\u003da0b72e2e13b4d6ce1776787f5f455732e77b1980;l\u003d14) that are setting `min_sdk_version: \"VanillaIceCream\"` in aosp even without this change, and they seem to be building without any issues.",
      "parentUuid": "017626ee_58520873",
      "revId": "dcd110f5575a98dc1371a5be8a24e7db52a92f1a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6b133362_91f1df82",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
