      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-19T18:11:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e oh, then what\u0027s the usecase for this change? Is there a particular module that\u0027s not working?\n\n\nyes, we need it for NFC Apex. See b/329995729, trying to fix it via http://ag/q/topic:%22nfc_min_sdk%22 caused a build breakage - b/330171104",
      "parentUuid": "6b133362_91f1df82",
      "revId": "dcd110f5575a98dc1371a5be8a24e7db52a92f1a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "13aa6c21_86c82ea0",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1962375
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-19T22:04:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The build target that was broken in [b/330171104](https://b.corp.google.com/issues/330171104) was built successfully when built with this change: [ABTD run](https://android-build.corp.google.com/abtd/run/L48900030002604615/). @colefaust@google.com Do you have any alternative solutions other than this?",
      "parentUuid": "5fd90126_6184db8a",
      "revId": "dcd110f5575a98dc1371a5be8a24e7db52a92f1a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ab2f55ba_05dd3f77",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-19T22:09:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have no alternative solutions, but if we\u0027re going to go with this change, can we at least get a detailed explanation about what\u0027s going on first?\n\nThat would include why the module in question fails to build without this change, and why other modules can set `min_sdk_version: \"VanillaIceCream\"` just fine without this change.",
      "parentUuid": "13aa6c21_86c82ea0",
      "revId": "dcd110f5575a98dc1371a5be8a24e7db52a92f1a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0bbb859b_94b33100",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1074459
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-19T23:37:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking the usage in internal branch - https://source.corp.google.com/search?q\u003d%22min_sdk_version:%20%5C%22VanillaIceCream%5C%22%22\u0026sq\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main\n\nAll of the existing usages seems to be working around this issue by overriding the `min_sdk_version`. \n\nFor ex:\n\n1. NFC usage - https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/apps/Nfc/Android.bp;drc\u003d97e21d376f958f50bf88987d12010f0dfaaf20ba;l\u003d27\n\nis overridden here (where the library is statically included): https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/apps/Nfc/Android.bp;drc\u003d97e21d376f958f50bf88987d12010f0dfaaf20ba;l\u003d83\n\n2. V apex default - https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/common/sdk/ModuleDefaults.bp;drc\u003d7fe8448082e2175b61a231d6182da8055616e35f;l\u003d281\n\n\nis overridden by all the users: https://source.corp.google.com/search?q\u003dv-launched-apex-module\u0026sq\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main\n\nlike this one: https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/WebViewBootstrap/apex/Android.bp;drc\u003d57e76ad82bda752a72d17dc4ccc7f1ddcb781220;l\u003d38",
      "parentUuid": "ab2f55ba_05dd3f77",
      "revId": "dcd110f5575a98dc1371a5be8a24e7db52a92f1a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "eef53b80_3acb7154",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1962375
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-19T23:44:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe that the correct fix is to add `VanillaIceCream` to [`mainline.scl`](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:vendor/google/release/build_config/mainline.scl;drc\u003d7405d63b7e3bec93c2fc61e78f89ffef2a7ce9de;l\u003d44). This value is set as `VanillaIceCream` by default in [`build_flags.scl`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/release/build_flags.scl;drc\u003d01ab42f9d5519cbae24d786a34c0f6cdfac0816c;l\u003d178), but overridden in `mainline.scl`. This explains why the build breakage was observed only in `mainline` release configuration builds.\n\nThis build flag value is passed to [`PreviewApiLevels()`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/android/config.go;drc\u003d07145109fffd6361d79266ef2a8f966d8c53906f;l\u003d951).",
      "parentUuid": "0bbb859b_94b33100",
      "revId": "dcd110f5575a98dc1371a5be8a24e7db52a92f1a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
